From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 07:15:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] shell: "Restart Phosh" instead of "Restart UI"

Plinius: the entry in the system menu of the quick settings, the one in
the power menu and the question before restarting name what restarts:
Phosh. The compositor and the apps keep running, so "the interface" was
too broad.

Translations for de, es, fr, it, nl, pl, pt, pt_BR and ru.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
